syms a b c p q r x
eq1 = ap + bq + cr == 28;
eq2 = a + b + c == 10;
eq3 = x == a + 2*b - c/3;

% Solve the system of equations for a, b, and c
sol = solve([eq1, eq2, eq3], [a, b, c]);

% Substitute the values of a, b, and c from sol into equation eq3 to solve for x
x_value = sub(eq3, {a, b, c}, sol);

% Display the solution for x
disp(['The value of x is: ', num2str(x_value)]);
```

