}
else
{
    // The car price doesn't meet the constraint. Adjust it by adding the difference between the desired price and the current price.
    double difference = 2 * combinedPrice - carPrice;
    carPrice += difference;
}
```
1. Calculate the total cost of the purchase:
```csharp
double totalCost = carPrice + combinedPrice;
```
1. Output the result:
```csharp
