To fix the CORS error in Next.js with WordPress, you need to add the necessary CORS headers to your WordPress server. You can do this by adding the following code to your `wp-config.php` file:

```php
<?php
add_filter('wp_headers', 'add_cors_headers');
function add_cors_headers($headers) {
    $headers['Access-Control-Allow-Origin'] = 'https://your-nextjs-app.com'; // Replace with your Next.js app URL
